Name Belgium Note - Antwerp Civilian #1


Interactability_Text_Line_0 There’s nothing left here in Antwerp. It seems like everyone has scavenged anything useful. 
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 I think I’m going to leave Antwerp.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 I’m leaving Antwerp because I heard about a refugee camp in West Belgium. I’ll have a better chance of survival there.
Interactability_Text_Line_5 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_6  -Lliam

